" وتابِع أرصدة الموزّعين — كل ذلك من صفحة واحدة بتبويبات."
msgstr ""
"Collection and Payments Center: track requests, review payment proofs, "
"reconcile entries, and follow distributor balances — all from a single "
"tabbed page."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_finance_collection.html:31
msgid "مركز التحصيل وتبويباته"
msgstr "The Collection Center and its tabs"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_finance_collection.html:32
