"فيرسلها الراوتر إلى اللوحة عبر RADIUS، وحين تقبلها اللوحة يُفتح له "
"الإنترنت."
msgstr ""
"The router itself hosts it. On it the customer enters their card code or "
"subscription credentials, the router sends them to the panel via RADIUS, "
"and when the panel accepts them the internet is opened for him."

