"الراوتر أو ترفضها، وهو السبب الأشيع لـ«المصادقة لا تعمل أصلًا»."
msgstr ""
"The key set on the router is the same one you entered in the «Shared "
"Secret» field in the panel — character for character. Any difference "
"(even a space) makes the panel ignore or reject the router's requests, "
"and it is the most common cause of «authentication not working at all»."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_radius.html:118
msgid "ماذا يحدث لحظة محاولة الاتصال:"
msgstr "What happens at the moment of a connection attempt:"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_radius.html:121
msgid "المشترك يدخل بياناته (اسم/كلمة مرور أو كود بطاقة) على الراوتر."
msgstr ""
"The subscriber enters their credentials (username/password or card code) "
"on the router."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_radius.html:122
msgid "الراوتر يبني طلب"
msgstr "The router builds a request"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_radius.html:122
msgid "ويوقّعه بالمفتاح المشترك ويرسله للوحة."
