msgstr ""
"The router applies the answer: it opens the connection and applies the "
"speed limits, or blocks it and shows a message."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_radius.html:129
msgid "عند القبول، قد تُرسل اللوحة أيضًا"
msgstr "On approval, the panel may also send"

