msgstr "From where they connected."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:81
msgid "العنوان الفيزيائي (MAC) وعنوان الشبكة (IP):"
msgstr "The physical address (MAC) and the network address (IP):"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:81
msgid "جهاز الزبون."
msgstr "The customer's device."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:85
msgid "الجلسة بلا وقت انتهاء غالبًا"
msgstr "The session usually has no end time"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:85
msgid "— مفيد لمعرفة من هو متّصل فعليًّا في اللحظة."
msgstr "— useful to know who is actually connected at the moment."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:93
msgid "اقرأ الاستهلاك والمدّة"
msgstr "Read the consumption and duration"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:95
msgid "لكل جلسة قيمتان أساسيّتان للتشغيل والفوترة:"
msgstr "Each session has two key values for operation and billing:"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:98
msgid ""
"ما نزّله الزبون (download) وما رفعه (upload) بالبايت/الميجابايت — "
"مجموعهما هو استهلاك الجلسة."
msgstr ""
"What the customer downloaded (download) and uploaded (upload) in "
"bytes/megabytes — their sum is the session's consumption."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:99
msgid "المدّة:"
msgstr "Duration:"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_sessions_report.html:99
