msgstr "The customer requests transferring their balance to their bank account."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_store_support.html:61
msgid "شات الدعم:"
msgstr "Support chat:"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_store_support.html:61
msgid "محادثة نصّية مع كل زبون + إرفاق صورة."
msgstr "Text chat with each customer + image attachment."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_store_support.html:62
msgid "محافظ الاستلام:"
msgstr "Receiving wallets:"

#: app/templates/radius/docs_store_support.html:62
msgid "قنوات الدفع التي يعرضها المتجر للزبون قبل التحويل."
msgstr "The payment channels the store offers the customer before the transfer."

#: app/templates/radius/docs_store_support.html:66
msgid "الطلبات تُرتَّب تلقائيًّا:"
msgstr "Requests are sorted automatically:"

