msgstr "Hasn't happened yet"

#: app/templates/radius/license_activate.html:35
msgid "لم تختر باقة بعد؟ اعرض باقات المزوّد واختر الأنسب لك."
msgstr ""
"Haven't chosen a plan yet? View the provider's plans and pick the one "
"that suits you best."

#: app/templates/radius/license_activate.html:45
