msgstr ""
"What you save here may not take effect until these variables are removed "
"from the environment file and the instance is restarted."

#: app/templates/radius/license_connect.html:51
#: app/templates/radius/license_connect.html:92
msgid "ربط وتفعيل الآن"
msgstr "Link and activate now"

#: app/templates/radius/license_connect.html:51
msgid "الخطوة الوحيدة"
msgstr "The only step"

#: app/templates/radius/license_connect.html:53
msgid ""
"تَحتاج بَعدَ تفعيل الترخيص من لوحة المزوّد إلى أمرين فقط لنقل العقد إلى "
"هذه النسخة: رابط لوحة المزوّد + مفتاح الترخيص الخاص بك. يَجلبهما النظام "
"مَرّة، يَحفظهما، ويَفتح اللوحة فورًا."
msgstr ""
"After activating the license from the provider panel, you need only two "
"things to transfer the contract to this instance: the provider panel URL "
"+ your license key. The system fetches them once, saves them, and opens "
"the panel immediately."

#: app/templates/radius/license_connect.html:60
