" من أي مستوى صلاحية — بما في ذلك المدير الرئيسي — حتى يتم تفعيلها من لوحة"
" التراخيص. هذا قرار تجاري وليس قيدًا داخليًّا."
msgstr ""
"This service is disabled under the current service contract from the "
"system provider. It cannot be used at any permission level — including "
"the primary admin — until it is activated from the licensing panel. This "
"is a commercial decision, not an internal restriction."

