" provider panel). When the provider sets a service to the «Suspended "
"(hard stop)» state, it is permanently blocked throughout RADIUS — the "
"item disappears from the sidebar, the direct link won't open, and all "
"related write operations are rejected. This deliberately applies even to "
"the primary administrator (super), because the provider is a commercial "
"authority above internal permissions."

